  "promptText": {
    "original": {
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "value": "精致立体刺绣风插画，浅浮雕纤维艺术效果，纯净「蚕丝白 + 奶白」底色，细腻丝线质感。画面为数只小鸟停在蜿蜒花枝上，周围点缀粉白、浅桃、珊瑚粉、淡金色花朵与叶片，构图轻盈雅致、留白充足。鸟儿羽毛以奶白、浅蓝、淡粉、浅金丝线刺绣表现，花枝纤细自然，花朵层层叠线，整体呈现高级手工刺绣、丝线堆绣、柔和光影、细节丰富、温柔清新的艺术效果。",
      "source": "upstream"
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "language": "en",
        "value": "Exquisite three-dimensional embroidery-style illustration, shallow relief fiber art effect, pure 'silk white + cream white' background color, delicate thread texture. The picture shows several small birds perched on winding branches, surrounded by pink and white, light peach, coral pink, and light golden flowers and leaves, with a light and elegant composition and ample white space. The birds' feathers are embroidered with cream white, light blue, light pink, and light golden threads, the branches are slender and natural, and the flowers are layered with threads. The overall presents a high-end handmade embroidery, thread pile embroidery, soft light and shadow, rich details, and gentle and fresh artistic effect.",
        "source": "ai",
        "translatedAt": "2026-05-06T13:03:50.479Z"
      }
    }
  },
